<title>USA: American Stores Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>American Stores Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.44		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net		 64,095		   121,544</p>
<p> Sales	     4,909,673		5,090,584</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  145,829		  146,390</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.97		    $2.16</p>
<p> Net		 287,221		  316,809</p>
<p> Sales	     18,678,129	     18,308,894</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  145,888		  146,943</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 results include special charges of $100 million, pre-tax ($0.41 per share, after tax) included in cost of merchandise sold ($10 million), operating expenses ($15.5 million) and other non-operating ($74.5 million). EPS before the charges were $0.85 and $2.38 for the quarter and year-to-date, respectively.</p>
<p>Beginning with the first quarter of 1996, advertising expense is classified as cost of sales, rather than operating expense. Prior periods have been reclassified to conform to the new presentation.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
